== the program
== over TCP
GET /hello: 200 hello
HEAD /hello: 200 , Content-Length 5
POST /echo: 200 some text (text/x-test)
GET /query: 200 query: a=1&b=two%20words
GET /big: 200 300000 bytes
GET /moved: 200 hello
POST /see: 200 query: from=see
GET /loop: error: too many redirects
GET /nowhere: 404 no /nowhere
GET /smuggle: 500 the handler's response can't be sent
GET /nothing: 204 
POST /echo, 2000 bytes: 413 Content Too Large
GET /secret: 200 Bearer abc
GET /stream: 200 piece 1; piece 2; piece 3;  (chunked)
== refused by the server
not HTTP: 400
a head past the limit: 431
two requests on a connection: 200, 404
a request that never ends: 408
Expect: 100-continue: 100, 200
a chunked body: 200
two lengths: 400
an upgrade asked for, and not given: 200
a stream to HTTP/1.0, ended by the close: 200
== over TLS
GET /hello: 200 hello
HEAD /hello: 200 , Content-Length 5
POST /echo: 200 some text (text/x-test)
GET /query: 200 query: a=1&b=two%20words
GET /big: 200 300000 bytes
GET /moved: 200 hello
POST /see: 200 query: from=see
GET /loop: error: too many redirects
GET /nowhere: 404 no /nowhere
