GET /stream: 200 piece 1; piece 2; piece 3;  (chunked)
without the certificate trusted: error: X509 - Certificate verification failed, e.g. CRL, CA or signature check failed: The certificate is not correctly signed by the trusted CA
plain HTTP to it: []
== requests' bodies in pieces
POST /upload, 500000 bytes: 200 500000 bytes, in more than one piece: true
a handler that doesn't read: 200 
an unread body, then the next request: 404, 200
== a session's connections
two requests: 200 hello; 200 query: second; connections made: 1
after the server closed it: 200 hello; connections made: 2
a POST: 200 BBB; connections made: 3
== a stop
the request being answered: 200 slow, and whole
the server: true
a request after it: error: the socket
== refused by the client
ftp://example.org/: error: bad URL: it must begin with http:// or https://
http://user@example.org/: error: bad URL: a user name in it
http://example.org:99999/: error: bad URL: its port
http://exa mple.org/: error: bad URL: its host
http://127.0.0.1:1/: error: the socket
a header with a line end: error: not HTTP: a header or the method can't be sent
exit 0
